      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRUNKEY FRANK (1) jumped from out wide and was game in defeat last start when a nose second (17.51) behind Avatar Of Fun at this track. Has never been out of the placings from four starts out of this box. Top chance in this line up. RADIO RAMSGATE (5) was a strong winner (17.21) from box 4 last time, scoring by 2.75 lengths at this track. Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Winner at her latest appearance in one of the quickest times on the card. Should feature again. ASTON CREMA (2) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 17.32 beating Whiskey Bent. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. CARIBBEAN COOL (3) should be thereabouts.",
